# Design History Fusion (Cursor rule)

This rule does not restate the skill. Load the packaged skill and follow it in full:

1. Read [`.cursor/skills/design-history-fusion/SKILL.md`](../skills/design-history-fusion/SKILL.md) before doing anything else.
2. Follow every `references/` file that skill tells you to open — especially `timeline.md`, `fusion-playbook.md`, `output-templates.md`, and `anti-slop.md`. Those files are the rigor standard; do not paraphrase them from memory.
3. Produce Research or Fusion output in the templates from `references/output-templates.md`. Do not invent a parallel format.

Canonical source of truth for edits: [`design-history-fusion/`](../../design-history-fusion/). Packaged copies are synced with `node scripts/sync-packages.mjs`.
